LEEDO FOODCARE

FINAL MASTER PROMPT FOR GOOGLE AI STUDIO BUILD MODE

Build a complete, professional, secure, production-ready organizational application named LEEDO FOODCARE for LEEDO (Local Education and Economic Development Organization), Bangladesh.

The application will manage centralized grocery procurement, inventory, shelter-wise distribution, receiving confirmation, daily food consumption, meal management, child attendance, budgets, accounts, market price history, employee access, management monitoring, and comprehensive reporting.

This must be a fully functional application connected to Firebase, not a static design, mockup, or demo.

---

1. APPLICATION PURPOSE

LEEDO FOODCARE will provide a centralized system for managing food and grocery requirements for three residential facilities.

The system must enable Head Office to:

- Manage all procurement.
- Maintain central stock.
- Distribute groceries to facilities.
- Track actual receiving confirmation.
- Monitor facility-wise stock.
- Track daily food consumption.
- Monitor children, attendance, and meals.
- Calculate food cost per child.
- Monitor market prices.
- Verify bills and expenditure.
- Monitor budgets.
- Generate management reports.
- Maintain six years or more of historical records.
- Print and export all reports.
- Monitor all activities through audit logs.

The entire application must be designed around transparency, accountability, inventory accuracy, financial integrity, and child nutrition monitoring.

